Juiblex is one of the demon lords of Hell; he can do a number of
unpleasant things when he attacks, such as causing a disease that's
almost immediately fatal.

He probably appeared because you #offer'ed a humanoid corse at the
altar.   (After all, how else would you summon a demon?)  Since you're
playing a chaotic character, such #offerings are beneficial.  If you
were playing a neutral or lawful character, human sacrifice would be a
*big* mistake.

You could try using a scroll of taming to make him into a pet; as it is
now, he's just a peaceful monster.

If you can't tame him, just leave him there....

